graph TD
    subgraph Trigger
        Cron[Vercel Cron / node-cron]
        Manual[Dashboard "run now" / MCP client]
    end

    subgraph Application
        Dashboard[apps/dashboard - Next.js]
        API[/api/cron/[moduleId]/]
    end

    subgraph Engine["packages/ai-engine"]
        Runner[AgentRunner]
        M1[Marketing Strategist AI]
        M2[Meta Ads Operator AI]
        M3[Sales Supervisor AI]
        M4[Finance Analyst AI]
        M5[CEO Assistant AI]
    end

    Scheduler[packages/scheduler]
    Notif[packages/notifications]
    Security[packages/security]
    Connectors[packages/connectors - mocked]
    DB[(packages/database\nRepository)]
    MCP[packages/mcp-server]

    Cron --> API --> Scheduler
    Manual --> Dashboard
    Scheduler --> Runner
    Runner --> M1 & M2 & M3 & M4 & M5
    M1 --> Connectors
    M2 --> Connectors
    M2 --> Security
    M3 --> DB
    M4 --> DB
    M5 --> M1 & M2 & M3 & M4
    M1 & M2 & M3 & M4 & M5 --> Notif
    M1 & M2 & M3 & M4 & M5 --> DB
    Notif --> DB
    Dashboard --> DB
    MCP --> DB
    MCP --> Engine

    Connectors -.mock only, blocked.-> MKConnect[MK Connect / mkh.haluoleo.id]

